/**
 * K3 implant 路 W4-T4 路 canary L2 鈥?runtime tripwire sentinels (搂4.3.3, T1鈥揟12).
 *
 * COMPONENT TRIPLE (verification_kernel.md 搂4.3.8)
 * - Reason to exist : a statically well-shaped guard can still fail to intercept at runtime;
 *                     "the shape is right" 鈮?"it actually blocked" (Axiom 6). Every playbook
 *                     stages one known-bad behaviour against the REAL enforcement path and
 *                     asserts BOTH (a) interception and (b) a ledger row.
 * - Axiom binding   : Axiom 6 (empirical verification), Axiom 5 (every trigger is a ledger row).
 * - Deprecation     : NOT deprecable.
