/**
 * K3 implant 路 W6-T6 路 effort contract (Axiom 9 obligation 1, 搂4.1.9 / 搂4.2.6).
 *
 * COMPONENT TRIPLE
 * - Reason to exist : effort is a FIRST-CLASS HARNESS CONTROL VARIABLE, not a by-product of
 *                     prompting. A harness that cannot measure how much work a phase actually
 *                     did can only push on text volume 鈥?which is exactly the failure the floor
 *                     table (搂4.2.6) exists to prevent ("10 shallow retrievals 鈮?1 deep one").
 *                     The contract declares per-phase budgets and floors up front, and meters
 *                     actual effort PARASITICALLY on the W2 event ledger: it owns no storage,
 *                     keeps no counters, and trusts no self-report 鈥?a retrieval that is not in
 *                     the ledger does not exist (搂4.2.6 honesty clause).
 * - Axiom binding   : Axiom 9 obligation 1 (effort metering rides the event ledger), Axiom 5
 *                     (the lossless read path is the only source of effort truth).
 * - Deprecation     : the four metering queries and the self-report exclusion are NOT
 *                     deprecable (they are the gate's extensive-floor data source, W3 P1鈥揚4).
 *                     The three-lens cost split follows GAP-010's continuation obligation and
 *                     may gain lenses, never merge them. Mode residency (daily Q&A stays out of
 *                     project mode) is retired only if K3 ever drops the daily-QA surface.
 *
 * SELF-REPORT NEVER COUNTS (搂4.2.6): metering rejects (a) whole event families that are claims
 * about progress rather than observed work, and (b) any effort.* row that flags itself as
 * self-reported. The reconciliation helper turns "claimed vs measured" gaps into ledger rows
 * instead of silent trust.
